{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 19, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to the land of the rising sun! A journey grand awaits thee a tapestry of wonders spun.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City's Gleam**\n\nThou arrivest in Tokyo a metropolis bright.\nNarita's gates shall open to thy sight.\nHotel find a haven safe and sound.\nThen wander forth where bustling streets abound.\nShibuya's crossing a spectacle to behold.\nHarajuku's fashion stories yet untold.\nDinner partake of ramen rich and deep.\nAnd slumber sound where weary travelers sleep.\n\n**Day Two: Ancient Temples Modern Grace**\n\nAs early rise and seek the Meiji Shrine's peace.\nWhere emperors once walked finding sweet release.\nThen journey forth to Asakusa's old town.\nSensoji Temple's grandeur doth renown.\nExplore the market stalls a vibrant hue.\nAnd sample treats both strange and ever new.\nTokyo Skytree a view sublime.\nA panorama grand transcending space and time.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty Nature's Embrace**\n\nTo Hakone's hills we now shall swiftly ride.\nA mountain realm where beauty doth reside.\nCruise Lake Ashi a mirror calm and clear.\nMount Fuji's peak a vision held so dear.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm.\nA tranquil escape from worldly harm.\nArt museums grace this verdant land.\nA masterpiece created by a skillful hand.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Charm a Cultural Dream**\n\nBy train we journey to Kyoto's ancient heart.\nWhere history whispers a poignant work of art.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermilion maze.\nA thousand torii in sunlit haze.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a shimmering gleam.\nA Zen garden's solace a waking dream.\nGion district wander where geishas tread.\nA fleeting glimpse of beauty softly spread.\n\n**Day Five: Nara's Deer a Gentle Scene**\n\nTo Nara we venture deer so free.\nThey bow and offer gifts for thee.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha's might.\nA colossal statue bathed in golden light.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow.\nA pathway lit where ancient spirits flow.\nReturn to Kyoto a peaceful end.\nA journey's tale a faithful friend.\n\n**Day Six: Departure Farewell to Japan**\n\nThy journey nears its final stage.\nTo Narita's gates thy spirit will engage.\nReflect on wonders seen and joys embraced.\nA memory etched a time well graced.\nFarewell Japan a land of grace.\nUntil we meet again in time and space.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.516659677028656}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009209651499986649}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.16942277550697327}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.052428126335144}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.4418279528617859}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.00015686711412854493}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.014928764663636684}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.1346064805984497}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00010895135346800089}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.19080637395381927}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.1299317628145218}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.08824119716882706}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -1.1333613395690918}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.06169922649860382}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.22186166048049927}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -1.3802039623260498}, {"token": "▁tapestry", "logprob": -1.0916597843170166}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.05542955920100212}, {"token": "▁wonders", "logprob": -1.1673572063446045}, {"token": "▁spun", "logprob": -0.6298869252204895}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.008117777295410633}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.03638256713747978}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.001149351242929697}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.25734227895736694}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.8322307467460632}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.07432983070611954}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.013409662060439587}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.000159727